# Video section scope

When working on the **video** block, change only video-related files. Do not edit hero, nav, gallery, other components, or unrelated styles/scripts.

## Allowed files

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Markup | `components/FULLGREATBROS.html` |
| Styles | `styles/video.css` |
| Images & media | `assets/images/video/**` |
| Embed / play behavior | `scripts/modules/video.js` |

## Optional (with user approval)

- `scripts/config.js` — only the `video` object (`title`, `defaultUrl`)
- `assets/svg/video-bg-pattern.svg` — background pattern used by the video frame

## Branding

- Section identity: **FULL GREAT BROS** (corner labels, overlay title, iframe `title`).
- Do not revert to FG'S AUTO / 富贵车房 copy in this section unless the user asks.

## Assets

- Put new video-section images under **`assets/images/video/`**.
- Reference from markup/CSS like `assets/images/video/your-file.webp`.

## Examples

```html
<!-- ✅ video.html -->
<div class="video-corner vc-tl">FULL GREAT</div>
<div class="video-corner vc-br">BROS</div>
```

If a change requires `index.html` or another section, ask the user before editing outside this scope.
